    "de": [
      "Schneeschuhwandern, Wellness-Waldtherapie, Qigong, Yoga, Botanik, Nordic Walking, Pilates.\r\nEine andere Art, sich dem Wandern zu nähern, für alle zugänglich, im Rhythmus der Natur …"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Snowshoeing, wellness forest therapy, Qigong, yoga, botany, Nordic walking, Pilates.\r\nAnother way to approach walking, accessible to all, at the rhythm of nature..."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Ciaspolate, silvoterapia, Qigong, yoga, botanica, nordic walking e pilates.\r\nUn approccio diverso alla camminata, accessibile a tutti, al ritmo della natura?"
